  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Australis Climate-Smart Barramundi and Seaweed Aquaculture Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project involves an equity investment of up to $15 million in Australis Holdings, Inc. (AHI) for the Australis Climate-Smart Barramundi and Seaweed Aquaculture Project in Viet Nam. The report describes the administration of a grant of up to $3 million to be provided by the Climate Innovation and Development Fund (CIDF).</narrative>
